整答得出來的人其實不多。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶怎麼用？冥想、助眠、空間淨化實戰完整指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E5%8A%A9%E7%9C%A0%E7%A9%BA%E9%96%93%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%A6%E6%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E5%8A%A9%E7%9C%A0%E7%A9%BA%E9%96%93%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%A6%E6%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;買了紫水晶，然後呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>